  "goodToKnow": "Der Schiedsrichter (die Schiedsrichterin) is a referee in sport, casually der Schiri: Schiri, wir wissen, wo dein Auto steht! is a notorious fan chant. In law and business, it's an arbitrator, and das Schiedsgericht is an arbitration court. From scheiden (to separate, decide) and der Richter (judge). Bibiana Steinhaus was the first woman to referee in the men's Bundesliga, in 2017."
